  m_Text: 'its a me mario does this look good or nah? i mean i typed pretty a lot,
    howevber the notpad is quite big, not sure if the text is going to be visible, 
    idk how i feel about this, what do u think make sure to tell me guys, the lines
    are not same distance so i would go with one without lines, because as u can
    see there is offset and the distance between the lines are not the same, atleast
    thats what i noticed and idk if i can fix it manuyally, but probably is going
    to be a hassle so fuck it ima use the one without lines  '
